{
    "comment": "주문서 항목 구획의 **좁은 화면 카드 판**(#490). 표 조각(`_checkout_fields_table`)이 768px 미만에서 이 조각을 그린다.\n  배선은 표와 같다. 스위치는 즉시 저장하고 `checkoutFieldDefs` 만 다시 받으며, 설정 폼과 「변경 있음」은 건드리지 않는다.\n  표의 열(구획, 항목, 출처, 사용, 필수, 동작)을 카드 한 장에 위에서 아래로 놓는다.",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "쇼핑몰 설정 > 주문 설정 탭 주문서 항목 카드(768px 미만) — 표와 같은 즉시 저장 배선"
    },
    "id": "checkout_fields_cards",
    "type": "basic",
    "name": "Div",
    "props": {
        "className": "ecommerce-divider-list"
    },
    "children": [
        {
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "iteration": {
                "source": "{{_computed.checkoutFields}}",
                "item_var": "row"
            },
            "props": {
                "id": "{{'checkout_field_card_' + row.key}}",
                "className": "ecommerce:p-4 ecommerce-row-stack"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "ecommerce-flex-start ecommerce:justify-between ecommerce:gap-3"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce:flex-1 ecommerce:min-w-0"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "ecommerce-text-primary ecommerce:font-medium ecommerce-break-all"
                                    },
                                    "text": "{{row.label ?? row.key}}"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "ecommerce-form-hint"
                                    },
                                    "text": "{{$t('sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.checkout_fields.group.' + (row.ui?.group === 'orderer' ? 'orderer' : 'shipping'))}}"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "P",
                                    "if": "{{!!$localized(row.description ?? {})}}",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "ecommerce-form-hint ecommerce-break-all"
                                    },
                                    "text": "{{$localized(row.description ?? {})}}"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce:flex-shrink-0"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "if": "{{row.is_custom === true}}",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "ecommerce:inline-block ecommerce:whitespace-nowrap ecommerce:px-2 ecommerce:py-0.5 ecommerce:rounded-full ecommerce:text-xs ecommerce:font-medium ecommerce:bg-blue-100 ecommerce:dark:bg-blue-900 ecommerce-tone-info-soft"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.checkout_fields.source.custom"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "if": "{{row.is_custom !== true && row.source_identifier === 'sirsoft-ecommerce'}}",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "ecommerce-text-tertiary ecommerce:whitespace-nowrap"
                                    },
                                    "text": "{{row.source_label ?? $t('sirsoft-ecommerce.common.module_name')}}"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "if": "{{row.is_custom !== true && row.source_identifier !== 'sirsoft-ecommerce'}}",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "ecommerce:inline-block ecommerce:whitespace-nowrap ecommerce:px-2 ecommerce:py-0.5 ecommerce:rounded-full ecommerce:text-xs ecommerce:font-medium ecommerce:bg-yellow-100 ecommerce:dark:bg-yellow-900 ecommerce-tone-warning-soft"
                                    },
                                    "text": "{{row.source_label ?? row.source_identifier ?? $t('sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.checkout_fields.source.extension')}}"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{row.available === false}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "ecommerce-flex-center ecommerce:flex-wrap ecommerce:gap-2"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce:inline-block ecommerce:whitespace-nowrap ecommerce:px-2 ecommerce:py-0.5 ecommerce:rounded-full ecommerce:text-xs ecommerce:font-medium ecommerce:bg-red-100 ecommerce:dark:bg-red-900 ecommerce-tone-error-soft"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.checkout_fields.unavailable"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce-text-label-subtle ecommerce:text-xs"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.checkout_fields.unavailable_desc"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{row.available !== false}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "ecommerce-flex-center ecommerce:flex-wrap ecommerce:gap-4"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce-flex-center ecommerce:gap-2"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "ecommerce-text-tertiary ecommerce:text-xs"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.checkout_fields.col.enabled"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "composite",
                                    "name": "Toggle",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "comment": "사용 스위치(카드 판). 표 판과 같은 배선이다.",
                                            "type": "change",
                                            "handler": "sequence",
                                            "if": "{{!_global.checkoutFieldBusy}}",
                                            "actions": [
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "target": "global",
                                                        "checkoutFieldBusy": "{{row.id + ':enabled'}}"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "apiCall",
                                                    "target": "/api/admin/field-sets/sirsoft-ecommerce.order_contact/fields/{{row.id}}",
                                                    "auth_required": true,
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "method": "PUT",
                                                        "body": {
                                                            "enabled": "{{!row.enabled}}",
                                                            "fields_version": "{{_computed.checkoutFieldsVersion}}"
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    "onSuccess": [
                                                        {
                                                            "handler": "toast",
                                                            "params": {
                                                                "type": "success",
                                                                "message": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.checkout_fields.saved"
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "handler": "updateDataSource",
                                                            "params": {
                                                                "dataSourceId": "checkoutFieldDefs",
                                                                "data": "{{ { ...(checkoutFieldDefs ?? { }), data: { ...(checkoutFieldDefs?.data ?? { }), fields_version: response?.data?.fields_version ?? checkoutFieldDefs?.data?.fields_version ?? null } } }}"
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                                            "params": {
                                                                "dataSourceId": "checkoutFieldDefs"
                                                            }
                                                        }
                                                    ],
                                                    "onError": [
                                                        {
                                                            "handler": "toast",
                                                            "params": {
                                                                "type": "error",
                                                                "message": "{{error.error_code === 'fields_changed' ? '$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.checkout_fields.changed_by_other' : (error.message ?? '$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.checkout_fields.save_failed')}}"
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                                            "params": {
                                                                "dataSourceId": "checkoutFieldDefs"
                                                            }
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "props": {
                                        "id": "{{'checkout_field_card_enabled_' + row.key}}",
                                        "checked": "{{Boolean(row.enabled)}}",
                                        "ariaLabel": "$t:common.row_cell|row={{row.label ?? row.key}}|column={{$t('sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.checkout_fields.col.enabled')}}",
                                        "size": "sm",
                                        "awaitConfirmation": true,
                                        "pending": "{{_global.checkoutFieldBusy === row.id + ':enabled'}}",
                                        "disabled": "{{_computed.checkoutFieldsReadOnly || !!row.locks?.enabled || !!_global.checkoutFieldBusy}}"
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "if": "{{!!row.locks?.enabled}}",
                                    "props": {
                                        "data-testid": "{{'checkout-field-card-enabled-lock-' + row.key}}",
                                        "role": "img",
                                        "aria-label": "{{row.locks?.enabled ?? ''}}",
                                        "title": "{{row.locks?.enabled ?? ''}}",
                                        "className": "ecommerce-text-muted"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Icon",
                                            "props": {
                                                "name": "lock",
                                                "className": "ecommerce:text-xs"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce-flex-center ecommerce:gap-2"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "ecommerce-text-tertiary ecommerce:text-xs"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.checkout_fields.col.required"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "composite",
                                    "name": "Toggle",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "comment": "필수 스위치(카드 판). 표 판과 같은 배선이다.",
                                            "type": "change",
                                            "handler": "sequence",
                                            "if": "{{!_global.checkoutFieldBusy}}",
                                            "actions": [
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "target": "global",
                                                        "checkoutFieldBusy": "{{row.id + ':required'}}"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "apiCall",
                                                    "target": "/api/admin/field-sets/sirsoft-ecommerce.order_contact/fields/{{row.id}}",
                                                    "auth_required": true,
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "method": "PUT",
                                                        "body": {
                                                            "required": "{{!row.required}}",
                                                            "fields_version": "{{_computed.checkoutFieldsVersion}}"
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    "onSuccess": [
                                                        {
                                                            "handler": "toast",
                                                            "params": {
                                                                "type": "success",
                                                                "message": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.checkout_fields.saved"
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "handler": "updateDataSource",
                                                            "params": {
                                                                "dataSourceId": "checkoutFieldDefs",
                                                                "data": "{{ { ...(checkoutFieldDefs ?? { }), data: { ...(checkoutFieldDefs?.data ?? { }), fields_version: response?.data?.fields_version ?? checkoutFieldDefs?.data?.fields_version ?? null } } }}"
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                                            "params": {
                                                                "dataSourceId": "checkoutFieldDefs"
                                                            }
                                                        }
                                                    ],
                                                    "onError": [
                                                        {
                                                            "handler": "toast",
                                                            "params": {
                                                                "type": "error",
                                                                "message": "{{error.error_code === 'fields_changed' ? '$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.checkout_fields.changed_by_other' : (error.message ?? '$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.checkout_fields.save_failed')}}"
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                                            "params": {
                                                                "dataSourceId": "checkoutFieldDefs"
                                                            }
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "props": {
                                        "id": "{{'checkout_field_card_required_' + row.key}}",
                                        "checked": "{{Boolean(row.required)}}",
                                        "ariaLabel": "$t:common.row_cell|row={{row.label ?? row.key}}|column={{$t('sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.settings.checkout_fields.col.required')}}",
                                        "size": "sm",
                                        "awaitConfirmation": true,
                                        "pending": "{{_global.checkoutFieldBusy === row.id + ':required'}}",
                                        "disabled": "{{_computed.checkoutFieldsReadOnly || !!row.locks?.required || !!_global.checkoutFieldBusy}}"
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "if": "{{!!row.locks?.required}}",
                                    "props": {
                                        "data-testid": "{{'checkout-field-card-required-lock-' + row.key}}",
                                        "role": "img",
                                        "aria-label": "{{row.locks?.required ?? ''}}",
                                        "title": "{{row.locks?.required ?? ''}}",
                                        "className": "ecommerce-text-muted"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Icon",
                                            "props": {
                                                "name": "lock",
                                                "className": "ecommerce:text-xs"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{row.is_custom === true && !_computed.checkoutFieldsReadOnly}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "ecommerce-flex-center ecommerce:justify-end ecommerce:gap-2"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Button",
                            "if": "{{row.available !== false}}",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "comment": "수정 창 열기(카드 판). 표 판과 같다.",
                                    "type": "click",
                                    "handler": "sequence",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "global",
                                                "checkout_field_form_modal": null
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "global",
                                                "checkout_field_form_modal": {
                                                    "isNew": false,
                                                    "errors": null,
                                                    "isSaving": false,
                                                    "fieldsVersion": "{{_computed.checkoutFieldsVersion}}",
                                                    "form": "{{({ id: row.id, key: row.key, type: row.type, type_label: row.type_label ?? row.type, group: row.ui?.group === 'orderer' ? 'orderer' : 'shipping', name: row.name ?? {}, description: Array.isArray(row.description) ? {} : (row.description ?? {}), options: row.options ?? [], enabled: row.enabled !== false, required: row.required === true })}}"
                                                }
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "openModal",
                                            "target": "checkout_field_form_modal"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "data-testid": "{{'checkout-field-card-edit-' + row.key}}",
                                "type": "button",
                                "aria-label": "$t:common.row_cell|row={{row.label ?? row.key}}|column={{$t('common.edit')}}",
                                "className": "ecommerce:text-sm ecommerce:px-3 ecommerce:py-1.5 ecommerce:rounded-md ecommerce:bg-indigo-600 ecommerce:text-white ecommerce:hover:bg-indigo-700 ecommerce:dark:bg-indigo-500 ecommerce:dark:hover:bg-indigo-600 ecommerce:transition-colors ecommerce:disabled:opacity-50 ecommerce:disabled:cursor-not-allowed ecommerce:disabled:hover:bg-indigo-600",
                                "disabled": "{{!!_global.checkoutFieldBusy}}"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "text": "$t:common.edit"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Button",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "comment": "삭제 창 열기(카드 판). 표 판과 같다.",
                                    "type": "click",
                                    "handler": "sequence",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "global",
                                                "checkout_field_delete_modal": null
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "global",
                                                "checkout_field_delete_modal": {
                                                    "id": "{{row.id}}",
                                                    "label": "{{row.label ?? row.key}}",
                                                    "isDeleting": false,
                                                    "fieldsVersion": "{{_computed.checkoutFieldsVersion}}"
                                                }
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "openModal",
                                            "target": "checkout_field_delete_modal"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "data-testid": "{{'checkout-field-card-delete-' + row.key}}",
                                "type": "button",
                                "aria-label": "$t:common.row_cell|row={{row.label ?? row.key}}|column={{$t('common.delete')}}",
                                "className": "ecommerce:text-sm ecommerce:px-3 ecommerce:py-1.5 ecommerce:rounded-md ecommerce:border ecommerce:border-red-300 ecommerce:dark:border-red-600 ecommerce:text-red-700 ecommerce:dark:text-red-400 ecommerce:hover:bg-red-50 ecommerce:dark:hover:bg-red-900/30 ecommerce:transition-colors ecommerce:disabled:opacity-50 ecommerce:disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                                "disabled": "{{!!_global.checkoutFieldBusy}}"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "text": "$t:common.delete"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
